  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1168962/description_85711f83-706f-4b5a-bae3-13626e836ee4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"169\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fminimal-armor-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/vwm4Ny7B?style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&labelColor=333333&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"28\"></a><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fxivill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1168962/description_3e3ed92a-ea85-4ecf-a175-511bc289f76f.png\" alt=\"Lintktree\" width=\"160\" height=\"28\"></a></strong></p>\n<h1><strong>注意：</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">請選擇符合您 Minecraft 版本的檔案！<strong>從 1.21.2 版本開始，盔甲紋理的儲存方式已變更</strong>，因此本資源包提供獨立版本以確保相容性。</span></p>\n<p>如需發光紋理功能，請安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>！</p>\n<h1><strong>關於資源包：</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<p>製作此資源包的目的在於精簡盔甲紋理，而非完全移除。如果您對標準盔甲模型感到厭倦，更希望能看到更多玩家的皮膚，那麼這個資源包將是您的最佳選擇。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8e4314c1-5cc9-416f-b2f9-6cf13c10c6cb.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"></p>\n<p>不過，除了海龜殼之外，頭盔的紋理已被移除，因為我想不到不依賴「把頭盔變成皇冠」這類過於俗套設計的方案。我也保留了金、皮革和鎖鏈盔甲的原樣，因為這些材質在玩家中較少使用……</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>……而且我就是懶</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>更新項目：</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>護腿 &rarr; 腰帶</li>\n<li>胸甲 &rarr; 扣環</li>\n<li>靴子 &rarr; 腰帶匕首</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c89a0b7d-270a-4a48-9f54-cb9923a5327e.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"289\" height=\"289\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>新紋理外觀如下：</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<p>下界合金：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fa6a2609-603a-4b96-8f70-66bf2e3e9cde.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"><br>鑽石：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_123837a8-b49c-4dde-8c00-c1a1aab98603.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"><br>鐵：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_63cc7610-7b5d-475b-abb9-9a69982dd699.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"><br>海龜殼：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f1980783-23c8-4a3a-bdda-bb837183b313.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"></p>",
